fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"base/gstbaseparse.html#gst_base_parse_set_syncable","fragment":"\n\tgst_base_parse_set_syncable\n\n\n\tGstBase.BaseParse.prototype.set_syncable\n\n\n\tGstBase.BaseParse.set_syncable\n\nSet if frame starts can be identified. This is set by default and\ndetermines whether seeking based on bitrate averages\nis possible for a format/stream.\nThis value is reset during PAUSED->READY state changes. Subclasses must\ncall this function from start if they want to set a static value.\nParameters:\na GstBaseParse\nset if frame starts can be identified\nSet if frame starts can be identified. This is set by default and\ndetermines whether seeking based on bitrate averages\nis possible for a format/stream.\nThis value is reset during PAUSED->READY state changes. Subclasses must\ncall this function from vfunc_start if they want to set a static value.\nParameters:\na GstBase.BaseParse\nset if frame starts can be identified\nSet if frame starts can be identified. This is set by default and\ndetermines whether seeking based on bitrate averages\nis possible for a format/stream.\nThis value is reset during PAUSED->READY state changes. Subclasses must\ncall this function from do_start if they want to set a static value.\nParameters:\na GstBase.BaseParse\nset if frame starts can be identified\n"});